hadiths[48]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1799","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Makka tashrif ley jatey to masjid shajra mein Namaz padhtey aur jab wapas hotey to zul-Hulaifa ki wadi ke nasheb mein Namaz padhtey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) subah tak saari raat wahin rehtey."
"1800","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (safar se) raat ko ghar nahi pahunchtey they ya subah ke waqt pahunch jatey ya do-pahar baad (zawaal se lekar ghurub aaftaab tak kisi bhi waqt tashrif laatey) ."
"1801","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (safar se) ghar raat ke waqt utarney se mana farmaya,"
"1802","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) safar se Madina wapas hotey aur Madina ke oopri ilaaqon par nazar padtii to apni ontni ko tez kar detey, koi doosra janwar hota to usey bhi eid lagaatey . abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( ne kaha ke Haaris-bin-Umair ne Humaid se ye lafz zyada kiye hain ke ''Madeena se mohabbat ki wjah se sawari tez kar detey they. ''ham se Quteba ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Ismail bin Jafar ne bayan kya, unse Humaid lamba ne aur unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne, unhon-ne ( darjaat ke bajaey) ( جدرات ( kaha, uski mutabiat (pairavi) Haris bin Umer ne ki."
"1803","ye aayat hamarey barey mein nazil hui. Ansar jab Haj ke liye aatey to (ehraam ke baad) gharon mein darwazon se nahi jatey balke diiwaaron se kood kar (ghar ke andar) dakhil hua kartey they phir (Islam laney ke baad) aik Ansari shakhs aaya aur darwazey se ghar mein dakhil ho gaya is par logon ne laanat malaamat ki to ye wahiy nazil hui ke ''ye koi neki nahi hai ke gharon mein peechhey se ( diiwaaron par chadh kar) aao balke nek wo shakhs hai jo taqwa ikhtiyar karey aur gharon mein unke darwazon se aaya karo."
"1804","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya safar azab ka aik tukda hai, aadmi ko khaney peeney aur soney (har aik cheez ( se rok deta hai, isliye jab koi apni zarurat poori kar chukey to fauran ghar wapas aa jaey."
"1805","main Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ke sath Makka ke rastey mein tha ke unhein (apni beewii) Safiya-bint-abii-Ubaid ki sakht bimari ki khabar mili aur wo bahut hi zyada tezi se chalney lagey, phir jab surkhi ghurub ho gaee to sawari se nichey utrey aur maghrib aur isha aik sath mila kar padhin, iske baad farmaya ke maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha ke jab jaldi chalnaa hota to maghrib mein der karke donon (ishaa aur maghrib) ko aik sath mila kar padhtey they."
"1806","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) fasaad ke zamane mein Umra karne ke liye jab Makka janey lagey to aap ne farmaya ke agar mujhey Kaba sharif pahunchne se rok diya gaya to main bhi wahi kaam karunga jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath ham logon ne kya tha, chunanche aap ne bhi sirf Umre ka ehram baandha kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi Hudaibiya ke saal sirf Umre ka ehram baandha tha."
"1807","jin dinon Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) par Hajjaj ki lashkar kashii ho rahi thi to Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se logon ne kaha (kyonke aap Makka jana chahtey they) ke agar aap us saal Haj na karein to koi nuqsan nahi kyonke dar iska hai ke kahin aapko Baitullah pahunchne se rok na diya jaey. aap boley ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath gaey they aur kuffaare-Quraish hamarey Baitullah tak pahunchne mein haail ho gaey they. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni qurbani nehar ki aur sar mundaa liya, Abdullah ne kaha ke main tumhen gawah banata hun ke maine bhi inshaAllah Umra apne par wajib qarar de liya hai. main zaroor jaaunga aur agar mujhey Baitullah tak pahunchne ka rasta mil gaya to tawaaf karunga, lekin agar mujhey rok diya gaya to main bhi wahi kaam karunga jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kya tha, main us waqt bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maujood tha chunanche aap ne zul-Hulaifa se Umre ka ehram baandha phir thodi door chal kar farmaya ke Haj aur Umra to aik hi hain, ab main bhi tumhen gawah banata hun ke maine Umra ke sath Haj bhi apne uper wajib qarar de liya hai, aap ne Haj aur Umra donon se aik sath farigh ho kar hi dasween Zil-Hijja ko ehram khola aur qurbani ki. aap farmatey they ke jab tak haji Makka pahunch kar aik tawaaf ziyaarat na kar ley pura ehram na kholnaa chahiye"
"1808","unse Naafe ne ke Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ke kisi betey ne unse kaha tha kash! aap us saal ruk jatey (to achchha hota usi uper waley waaqie ki taraf ishara hai)."
"1809","Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne unse farmaya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Hudaibiya ke saal Makka janey se rok diye gaey to aap ne Hudaibiya hi mein apna sar mundwaayaa aur paak beeviyon ke paas gaey aur qurbani ko nehar kya, phir aainda saal aik doosra Umra kya."
"1810","ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) farmaya kartey they kya tumharey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sunnat kafi nahi hai ke agar kisi ko Haj se rok diya jaey, ho sakey to wo Baitullah ka tawaaf kar ley aur Safa aur Marwa ki saee, phir wo har cheez se halal ho jaey, yahan tak ke wo doosrey saal Haj kar ley phir qurbani karey, agar qurbani na miley to roza rakhey, Abdullah se riwayat hai ke hamein Mamar ne khabar di, unse Zohri ne bayan kya ke mujh se Salim ne bayan kya, unse ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne usi pehli riwayat ki tarah bayan kya."
"1811","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par) qurbani sar mundwaaney se pahley ki thi aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ashaab ko bhi usi ka hukm diya tha."
"1812","Abdullah aur Salim ne Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se guftgu ki, (ke wo us saal Makka na jaaein) to unhon-ne farmaya ke ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Umre ka ehram baandh kar gaey they aur kuffaare-Quraish ne hamein Baitullah se rok diya tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni qurbani ko nehar kya aur sar mundaayaa."
"1813","fitne ke zamane mein jab Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) Makka ke iraadey se chaley to farmaya ke agar mujhey Baitullah tak pahunchney se rok diya gaya to main bhi wahi kaam karunga jo ( Hudaibiya ke saal ( maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath kya tha. aap ne Umre ka ehram baandha kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bhi Hudaibiya ke saal Umra hi ka ehram baandha tha. phir aap ne kuchh ghaur karke farmaya ke Umra aur Haj to aik hi hai, iske baad apne sathiyon se bhi yahi farmaya ke ye donon to aik hi hain. main tumhen gawah banata hun ke Umra ke sath ab Haj bhi apne liye maine wajib qarar de liya hai phir (Makka pahunch kar) aap ne donon ke liye aik hi tawaaf kya. aap ka khayal tha ke ye kafi hai aur aap qurbani ka janwar bhi sath le gaey they."
"1814","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya, ghaaliban juon se tum ko takleef hai, unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan ya Rasulullah! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir apna sar mundaa ley aur teen din ke rozey rakh ley ya chh miskinon ko khana khilaa de ya aik bakri zabah kar."
"1815","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Hudaibiya mein mere paas aa kar khadey huey to juein mere sar se barabar gir rahi thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ye juein to tumharey liye takleef deh hain. maine kaha ji haan, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya phir sar mundaa ley ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sirf ye lafz farmaya ke mundaa ley. unhon-ne bayan kya ke ye aayat mere hi barey mein nazil hui thi ke ''agar tum mein koi mareez ho ya uske sar mein koi takleef ho ''aakhir aayat tak, phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya teen din ke rozey rakh ley ya aik farq ghalle se chh miskinon ko khana de ya jo muyassar ho uski qurbani kar de."
"1816","main Kab-bin-Ujra (Raziallahu anhu) ke paas betha hua tha, maine unse fidya ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke (qur'aan sharif ki aayat ( agarche khas mere barey mein nazil hui thi lekin iska hukm tum sab ke liye hai. hua ye ke mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laya gaya to juein sar se mere chehrey par gir rahi thin. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (ye dekh kar farmaya) main nahi samajhta tha ke tumhen itni zyada takleef hogi ya (aap ne yun farmaya ke) main nahi samajhta tha ke mashaqqat tumhen us had tak hogi, kya tujh mein bakri (bataur fidya) dene ki taqat hai? maine kaha ke nahi, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir teen din ke rozey rakh ya chh miskinon ko khana khilaa, har miskeen ko aadha saa khilaanaa."
"1817","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha to juein unke chehrey par gir rahi thin, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha kya un juon se tumhen takleef hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ji haan, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke apna sar mundaa lein. wo us waqt Hudaibiya mein they. (suleh Hudaibiya ke saal) aur kisi ko ye malum nahi tha ke wo Hudaibiya hi mein reh jaeinge balke sab ki khahish ye thi ke Makka mein dakhil hun. phir Allah Taala ne fidya ka hukm nazil farmaya aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya ke chh miskinon ko aik farq (yani teen saa ghalla) taqseem kar diya jaey ya aik bakri ki qurbani karey ya teen din ke rozey rakhey."
"1818","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein dekha to juein unke chehre par gir rahi thi, phir yahi hadis bayan ki."
"1819","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jis shakhs ne us ghar (ka'ba) ka Haj kya aur is mein na shahwat ki baat munh se nikaalii aur na koi gunah ka kaam kya to wo us din ki tarah wapas hoga jis din uski maan ne usey janaa tha."
"1820","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne us ghar ka Haj kya aur na shahwat ki fahash baatein kin, na gunah kya to wo us din ki tarah wapas hoga jis din uski maan ne usey janaa tha."
"1821","mere walid suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par) dushmanon ka pata lagaaney ( nikley. phir unke sathiyon ne to ehram baandh liya lekin) khud unhon-ne abhi ( nahi baandha tha ( asl mein) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kisi ne ye itlaa di thi ke maqam ghaiqa mein dushman aap ki taak mein hai, isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( abu-Qatada aur chand sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ko unki talash mein) rawaana kya mere walid ( abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu)) apne sathiyon ke sath they ke ye log aik doosrey ko dekh kar hansney lagey ( mere walid ne bayan kya ke) maine jo nazar uthai to dekha ke aik janglii gadhaa samney hai. main is par jhaptaa aur neze se usey thanda kar diya. maine apne sathiyon ki madad chahi thi lekin unhon-ne inkar kar diya tha, phir ham ne gosht khaayaa. ab hamein ye dar hua ke kahin (rasoolullaah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se) door na ho jaaein, chunanche maine aapko talash karna shuru kar diya kabhi apne ghodey tez kar deta aur kabhi aahista, aakhir raat gaey banu- ghifaar ke aik shakhs se mulaqat ho gaee. maine puchha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kahan hain? unhon-ne bataya ke jab main aap se juda hua to aap maqam Ta'hin mein they aur aap ka irada tha ke maqam Saqeeya mein pahunch kar do-pahar ka aaraam karengey. gharaz main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho gaya aur maine kaha ya Rasulullah ! aap ke ashaab aap par salam aur Allah ki rehmat bhejtey hain. unhein ye dar hai ke kahin wo bahut peechhey na reh jaaein. isliye aap thahar kar unka intizar karein, phir maine kaha ya Rasulullah! maine aik janglii gadhaa shikar kya tha aur uska kuchh bacha hua gosht ab bhi mere paas maujood hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon se khaney ke liye farmaya halanke wo sab ehram baandhey huey they."
"1822","ham suleh Hudaibiya ke mauqe par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath chaley unke sathiyon ne to ehram baandh liya tha lekin unka bayan tha ke maine ehram nahi baandha tha. hamein ghaiqa mein dushman ke maujood honey ki itlaa mili isliye ham unki talash mein (Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm ke mutabiq ( nikley phir mere sathiyon ne gorkhar dekha aur aik doosrey ko dekh kar hansney lagey maine jo nazar uthai to usey dekh liya ghodey par) Sawar ho kar) is par jhaptaa aur usey zakhmi karke thanda kar diya. maine apne sathiyon se kuchh imdaad chahi lekin unhon-ne inkar kar diya phir ham sab ne usey khaya aur uske baad main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua (pahley ( hamein dar hua ke kahin ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se door na reh jayen isliye main kabhi apna ghoda tez kar deta aur kabhi aahista aakhir meri mulaqat aik banii-Ghifaar ke aadmi se aadhi raat mein hui maine puchha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) kahan hain? unhon-ne bataya ke main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se Ta'hin naam ke jagah mein alag hua tha aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka irada ye tha ke do-pahar ko maqam Saqeeya mein aaraam karengey phir jab main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to maine kaha ya Rasulullah ! aap ke ashaab ne aapko salam kaha hai aur unhein dar hai ke kahin dushman aap ke aur unke darmyan haail na ho jaey isliye aap unka intizar kijiye chunanche aap ne aisa hi kya, maine ye bhi kaha ke ya Rasulullah ! maine aik gorkhar ka shikar kya aur kuchh bacha hua gosht ab bhi maujood hai is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne ashaab se farmaya ke khaao halanke wo sab ehram baandhey huey they."
"1867","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Madina haram hai falan jagah se falan jagah tak (yani Jabal eir se Saur tak) us had mein koi darakht na kaataa jaey na koi bidat ki jaey aur jisne bhi yahan koi bidat nikaalii is par Allah Taala aur tamam malaaika aur insanon ki laanat hai."
"1868","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab Madina (hijrat karke) tashrif laey to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne masjid ki tameer ka hukm diya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya aey banu-Najjaar tum (apni us zameen ki) mujh se qeemat ley lo lekin unhon-ne kaha ke ham uski qeemat sirf Allah Taala se maangtey hain. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mushrekeen ki qabron ke mutaalliq farmaya aur wo ukhaad di gain, weeraana ke mutaalliq hukm diya aur wo barabar kar diya gaya, khajoor ke darakhton ke mutaalliq hukm diya aur wo kaat diye gaey aur wo darakht qible ki taraf bichhaa diye gaey."
"1869","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Madina ke donon pathreeley kinaron mein jo zameen hai wo meri zaban par haram thahraaii gaee. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) banu- Harisa ke paas aaey aur farmaya banu-Haarisa! mera khayal hai ke tum log haram se bahar ho gaey ho, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mud kar dekha aur farmaya ke nahi balke tum log haram ke andar hi ho."
"1870","mere paas kitabullah aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us saheefe ke siwa jo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hawale se hai aur koi cheez (sharaee ehkaam se mutaalliq) likhi hui sura mein nahi hai. us saheefe mein ye bhi likha hua hai ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Madina Aair pahaadii se lekar falan maqam tak haram hai, jisne us had mein koi bidat nikaalii ya kisi bid'ati ko panah di to is par Allah aur tamam malaaika aur insanon ki laanat hai, na uski koi farz ibadat maqbool hai na nafl aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tamam musalmanon mein se kisi ka bhi ahad kafi hai isliye agar kisi musalman ki (dii hui aman mein doosrey musalman ne) bad-ahdii ki to is par Allah Taala aur tamam malaaika aur insanon ki laanat hai. na uski koi farz ibadat maqbool hai na nafl, aur jo koi apne Malik ko chhod kar uski ijazat ke baghair kisi doosrey ko Malik banaaey, is par Allah aur tamam malaaika aur insanon ki laanat hai, na uski koi farz ibadat maqbool hai na nafl."
"1871","maine Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey aik aisey Shahar (mein hijrat) ka hukm hua hai jo doosrey shehron ko kha lega. (yani sab ka sardaar banega) munaafeqeen usey yasrib kehtey hain lekin iska naam Madina hai wo (burey) logon ko is tarah bahar kar deta hai jis tarah bhattii lohey ke zang ko nikal deti hai."
"1872","ham ghazwa Tabook se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath wapas hotey huey jab Madina ke qareeb pahunchey to aap ne farmaya ke ye taaba aa gaya."
"1873","Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) farmaya kartey they agar main Madina mein hiran chartey huey dekhun to unhein kabhi na chhedoon kyonke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Madina ki zameen donon pathreeley maidaanon ke beech mein haram hai."
"1874","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum log Madina ko behtar haalat mein chhod jaogey phir wo aisa ujaad ho jaeyga ke phir wahan wahshii jaanwar, darind aur parind basney lagengey aur aakhir mein muzena ke 2 charwaahey Madina aaengey taake apni bakriyon ko haank ley jayen lekin wahan unhein sirf wahshii janwar nazar aaeingey aakhir saniyatul-wadaa' tak jab pahunchen gey to apne munh ke bal gir padengey."
"1875","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna ke aap ne farmaya ke Yaman fateh hoga to log apni sawaariyon ko daudaatey huey laaengey aur apne ghar walon ko aur unko jo unki baat maan jaeinge sawar karke Madina se (waapas Yaman ko) ley jaeinge kash! unhein malum hota ke Madina hi unke liye behtar tha aur Iraq fateh hoga to kuchh log apni sawaariyon ko tez daudaatey huey laaengey aur apne ghar walon ko aur jo unki baat maanengey apne sath (iraaq waapas) ley jaaenge. kash! unhein malum hota ke Madina hi unke liye behtar tha."
"1876","ham se khubaib-bin-Abdur-Rehmaan ne, unse hafs-bin-Aasim ne aur unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya (qiyamat ke qareeb) eman Madina mein is tarah simat aaeyga jaisey sanp simat kar apne bil mein aa jaya karta hai."
"1877","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke Madina walon ke sath jo shakhs bhi faraib karega wo is tarah ghul jaeyga jaisey namak mein pani ghul jaya karta hai."
"1878","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina ke mahallaat mein se aik mahal yani oonchey makan par chadhey phir farmaya ke jo kuchh mein dekh raha hun kya tumhen nazar aa raha hai? main boondon ke girney ki jagah ki tarah tumharey gharon par fitnon ke nazil honey ki jaghon ko dekh raha hun. is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Mamar aur Sulaimaan-bin-Kaseer ne Zohri ke waaste se ki hai."
"1879","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Madina par dajjal ka raub bhi nahi padega us daur mein Madina ke saat (7) darwazey hongey aur har darwazey par 2 Farishtey hongey."
"1880","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Madina ke raston par Farishtey hain na usmein taaoon aa sakta hai na dajjaal."
"1881","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya koi aisa Shahar nahi milega jisey dajjal paamaal na karega, siwaey Makka aur Madina ke, unke har rastey par saf basta Farishtey khadey hongey jo unki hifazat karengey phir Madina ki zameen teen martaba kaanpegii jis se eik-eik kaafir aur munafiq ko Allah Taala usmein se bahar kar dega."
"1882","ham se Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne dajjal ke mutaalliq aik lambi hadis bayan ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni hadis mein ye bhi farmaya tha ke dajjal Madina ki aik khaarii shor zameen tak pahunchega is par Madina mein daakhila to haram hoga. (Madina se) us din aik shakhs uski taraf nikal kar badhega, ye logon mein aik behtreen nek mard hoga ya (ye farmaya ke) buzurg tareen logon mein se hoga wo shakhs kahega ke main gawahi deta hun ke to wahi dajjal hai jiske mutaalliq hamein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne itlaa di thi. dajjal kahega kya main usey qatl karke phir zinda kar daalun to tum logon ko mere maamle mein koi shuba reh jaaeyga? iske hawaarii kahengey : nahi. chunanche dajjal unhein qatl karke phir zinda kar dega. jab dajjal unhein zinda kar dega to wo banda kahega b-khudaa ab to mujh ko pura haal malum ho gaya ke to hi dajjal hai dajjal kahega lao usey phir qatl kar dun lekin us martaba wo qaabu na pa sakega."
"1883","aik dehati ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar Islam par bait ki, doosrey din aaya to usey bukhar chadhaa hua tha kehney laga ke meri bait tod dijiye. teen baar usne yahi kaha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne inkar kya phir farmaya ke Madina ki misal bhattii ki si hai ke mail kuchail ko door karke khalis jauhar ko nikhaar deti hai."
"1884","jab Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jange-Uhud ke liye nikley to jo log Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they unmein se kuchh log wapas aagey (ye munaafeqeen they) phir kuchh ne to ye kaha ke ham chal kar unhein qatl kar dengey aur aik jamat ne kaha ke qatl na karna chahiye is par ye aayat nazil hui ( فما لكم في المنافقين فئتين‏ (aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne irshad farmaya ke Madina ( burey ( logon ko is tarah door kar deta hai jis tarah aag mail kuchail door kar deti hai."
"1885","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey Allaah! jitni Makka mein barkat ata farmai hai Madina mein us se dugnii barkat kar. Jarir ke sath is riwayat ki mutabiat (pairavi) Usman-bin-Umar ne Yunus ke waaste ke sath ki hai."
"1886","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab kabhi safar se wapas aatey aur Madina ki diiwaaron ko dekhtey to apni sawari tez farma detey aur agar kisi janwar ki pusht par hotey to Madina ki mohabbat mein usey aid lagaatey."
"1887","apne door waley makanon chhod kar masjide-Nabawi se qareeb iqamat ikhtiyar kar lein, lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye pasand na kya ke Madina ke kisi hisse se bhi rihaaish tark ki jaey, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke aey banu-Salma ! tum apne qadmon ka sawab nahi chahtey , chunanche banu- Salma ne (apni aslii iqamat gaah mein) rihaaish baqi rakhii."
"1888","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya mere ghar aur mere member ke darmyan ( wali jagah ( jannat ke baaghon mein se aik baagh hai aur mera member qiyamat ke din mere hauz ( kausar ( par hoga."
"1889","jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina tashrif laey to Abu-Bakar aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) bukhar mein mubtala ho gaey, Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) jab bukhar mein mubtala huey to ye sher padhtey : har aadmi apne ghar walon mein subah karta hai haalaanke uski maut uski jootii ke tasme se bhi zyada qareeb hai. aur Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ka jab bukhar utartaa to aap buland awaz se ye ashaar padhtey : kaash! mein aik raat Makka ki wadi mein guzaar sakta aur mere charon taraf izkhir aur Jaleel (ghaas) hotiin. kaash! aik din mein Majnaa ke pani par pahunchtaa aur kash! main shaamma aur Tufail ( pahadon ( ko dekh saktaa. kahaa ke aey mere Allah ! Sheba-bin-Rabee', Utba-bin-Rabeea aur Umayya-bin-Khalaf mardoodon par laanat kar. unhon-ne apne watan se us wabaa ki zameen mein nikala hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye sun kar farmaya aey Allah ! hamarey dilon mein Madina ki mohabbat isi tarah paida kar de jis tarah Makka ki mohabbat hai balke us se bhi zyaada! aey Allaah! hamarey saa aur hamarey mud mein barkat ata farma aur Madina ki aab w hua hamarey liye sihate-khair kar de yahan ke bukhar ko Juhaifa mein bhej de. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke jab ham Madina aaey to ye Allah ki sabse zyada wabaa wali sar zameen thi. unhon-ne kaha Madina mein Bathaan naam ke aik naala se zaraa-zaraa bd-maza aur badbudar pani baha karta tha."
"1890","aey Allaah! mujhey apne rastey mein shahadat ata kar aur meri maut apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke Shahar mein muqaddar kar de. ibne-Zareea' ne rooh-bin-Qaasim se, unhon-ne Zaid-bin-Aslam se, unhon-ne apni walida se, unhon-ne Hafsa-bint-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se bayan kya ke maine umr (Raziallahu anhu) se isi tarah suna tha, Hisham ne bayan kya, unse Zaid ne, unse unke walid ne, unse Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne ke maine umr (Raziallahu anhu) se suna phir yahi hadis riwayat ki."